#: 3f9580d2a0cd494786e2cbced544429e
msgid ""
"These lines configure the network address DNS servers and gateway "
"information that the RPi will assign to the clients connecting to it. If you"
" will use the RPi to bridge to another network through the ethernet "
"connection, it is important that this address range does not conflict with "
"the network the RPi is connected to through the ethernet connection. In "
"other words, if your local network uses the address range 192.168.42.xx you "
"need to select a different address range. Also the router address "
"192.168.42.1 will be the ip address of the RPi (we will set that up later "
"on)."
msgstr ""
"这些行配置了树莓派将分配给连接客户端的网络地址、DNS "
"服务器和网关信息。如果要使用树莓派通过以太网桥接到另一个网络，此地址范围不能与树莓派通过以太网连接的网络冲突。换言之，如果你的本地网络使用 "
"192.168.42.xx 地址范围，则需要选择不同的地址范围。另外，路由器地址 192.168.42.1 将是树莓派的 IP "
"地址（稍后我们将进行设置）。"

