"the RPi. The serial port UART goes to pins 8 (TXD) and 10 (RXD) on the P1 "
"header. We also need to provide power to the 3DR Radio by wiring pins 1 "
"(+5V) and pin 6 (GND)."
msgstr ""
"为了与飞行器通信，我们将使用树莓派的串口连接。串口 UART 连接到 P1 排针的引脚 8（TXD）和引脚 10（RXD）。还需要通过连接引脚 "
"1（+5V）和引脚 6（GND）为 3DR 电台供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/making-a-mavlink-wifi-bridge-using-the-raspberry-pi.rst:588
#: 4a6e769a03ce4c218948914555834e77
msgid ""
"The 3DR Radio V2 pins 1 (+5V), 2 (RXD), 3 (TXD) and 6 (GND) are the "
"corresponding pins to wire. Remember that the TXD on the Raspberry Pi needs "
"to be wired to the RXD on the 3DR Radio."
msgstr ""
"3DR Radio V2 的引脚 1（+5V）、2（RXD）、3（TXD）和 6（GND）是对应的连接引脚。请记住，树莓派的 TXD 需要连接到 3DR"
" 电台的 RXD。"

